---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Request a visibility diagnostic — DataDecision"
  description="Brief DataDecision on your AI-search visibility or measurement problem. The form is concise, accessible and connected only after a real provider endpoint is configured."
  path="/contact/"
  schema={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'ContactPage',
    name: 'Request a visibility diagnostic',
    url: 'https://datadecision.consulting/contact/',
    email: 'u22me137@med.svnit.ac.in',
  }}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Contact' }]} />
  <header class="shell page-hero page-hero--compact">
    <div class="page-hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Request a diagnostic</p><h1>Brief the problem, not the pitch.</h1><p
        class="lede"
      >
        Tell us what is difficult to see, measure or decide. The first review is about fit, scope
        and evidence—not pressure to buy an oversized engagement.
      </p>
    </div><aside class="page-hero__aside">
      <div class="folio"><span>What happens next</span><span>03 steps</span></div><div
        class="rule-list"
      >
        <div class="rule-row" style="grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr;">
          <span class="mono">01</span><div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Human review</h3><p>No automatic budget rejection.</p>
          </div>
        </div><div class="rule-row" style="grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr;">
          <span class="mono">02</span><div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Fit and scope</h3><p>
              The method must be able to answer the question.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div><div class="rule-row" style="grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr;">
          <span class="mono">03</span><div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.3rem;">Written next step</h3><p>
              Scope, fee, inputs and limitations before kickoff.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </header>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Diagnostic brief</p><h2>Seven fields. One useful starting record.</h2><p
          class="small"
        >
          The production form endpoint is intentionally not invented. In an unconfigured preview,
          submission remains local and reports the missing connection. You can also email <a
            href="mailto:u22me137@med.svnit.ac.in">u22me137@med.svnit.ac.in</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div><ContactForm />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--bright">
    <div class="shell editorial-grid">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Bring if available</p><h2>Inputs that make the first review sharper.</h2>
      </div><div class="comparison">
        <div>
          <h3>Visibility context</h3><ul>
            <li>Your product category and primary market.</li><li>
              Three to five products buyers compare.
            </li><li>Questions buyers ask before a shortlist.</li>
          </ul>
        </div><div class="comparison__rule"></div><div>
          <h3>Measurement context</h3><ul>
            <li>The dashboard or CRM disagreement.</li><li>Current tracking constraints.</li><li>
              The decision and deadline this work should support.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
